<title>THAILAND: U.S. Exim bank in loan pact with Total Access.</title>
<headline>U.S. Exim bank in loan pact with Total Access.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Export-Import Bank will sign an agreement with Thai mobile phone operator Total Access Communication Plc on Wednesday for a $104.8 million loan to support the sale of an advanced phone service.</p>
<p>A U.S. embassy statement said on Tuesday that the loan to assist in the sale of the phone service by American firm Motorola Inc represented the EXIM bank's largest authorisation in Thailand for fiscal year 1996.</p>
</text>
